<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 74.00-79.00, pkg 677 lbs 83.00, black; 700-800 lbs pkg 786 lbs 74.50. Holstein Large 2 500-600 lbs 57.00-61.00; 700- 800 lbs 45 head 791 lbs 66.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 500-600 lbs 72.50-79.00; 600- 700 lbs 69.50-75.90; 700-800 lbs 66.50-66.85.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 900</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
